00:27:37.930 --> 00:27:41.240
<v Male Child 3>Hey, great scrimmage, wasn't that?
<v Male Child 3>嘿，刚才的混战很棒，不是吗？

00:27:41.240 --> 00:27:51.730
<v Darren Stein>And basically, we have the football team coming up, and the baseball coach coming up. And at first, they see the gay guy, and they're like, ew, it's the gay guy. Let's beat him up. And then he opens the coin. And they're like, "Ooh, I'm gay."
<v Darren Stein>基本上，我们有足球队走过来，棒球教练走过来。起初，他们看到那个同性恋家伙，反应是，咦，是那个同性恋家伙。我们揍他一顿吧。然后他打开了硬币。他们就变成了，“噢，我是同性恋。”

00:27:51.730 --> 00:27:53.680
<v Male Child 3>Oh, it's the gay guy. Shouldn't we beat him up?
<v Male Child 3>噢，是那个同性恋家伙。我们不应该揍他一顿吗？

00:27:53.680 --> 00:27:55.620
<v Male Child 4>Yeah, come on.
<v Male Child 4>是啊，快点。

