<v Allen>Wait. Look at my coin.
<v Allen>等一下。看看我的硬币。

00:27:57.560 --> 00:28:04.380
<v Male Child 3>Oh my God. Roses, bouquets, flowers. Oh, my God. Roses.
<v Male Child 3>噢，天哪。玫瑰，花束，鲜花。噢，天哪。玫瑰。

00:28:04.380 --> 00:28:12.290
<v Ira Glass>One of the things I think is so funny about Gay as a Whistle is that as soon as the boys are turned into gay, the way that they express it is that they yell the words, "Roses."
<v Ira Glass>我觉得《像哨子一样直》里最滑稽的事情之一就是，男孩们一变成同性恋，他们表达的方式就是大喊“玫瑰”这个词。

00:28:12.290 --> 00:28:18.130
<v Darren Stein>Gay is about roses, for some reason.
<v Darren Stein>同性恋不知为何就成了玫瑰。

00:28:18.130 --> 00:28:23.870
<v Ira Glass>And did you feel like the film was about you? Or was it even that conscious?
<v Ira Glass>你觉得那部电影是在讲你吗？或者它甚至是有意识的吗？

00:28:23.870 --> 00:28:25.690
<v Darren Stein>It was not that conscious.
<v Darren Stein>那不是有意识的。

00:28:25.690 --> 00:28:29.000
<v Ira Glass>Did you think of yourself as gay back then?
<v Ira Glass>你那时觉得自己是同性恋吗？

00:28:29.000 --> 00:28:34.970
<v Darren Stein>No, I wouldn't admit that I was. But I think I knew I was. But I would never, ever admit it to anyone.
<v Darren Stein>不，我才不会承认。但我认为我知道。但我绝不会向任何人承认。

